  "description": "After graduating from the academy, Lien was living a perfectly ordinary life when, one day, sudden news reached her.\nDian—the sole heir to the kingdom’s only dukedom and her childhood friend—had fallen ill with a mysterious disease.\nIn search of a way to cure him, an oracle is brought forth from the Temple of Healing, but it reads:\n\"For fifteen days, at every sunrise and sunset, he must partake of a maiden’s milk.\"\n\"Is that even possible? Can a maiden produce milk?\"\n\"There is a magical potion; if she takes it, it becomes possible.\"\nWait, does that mean Dian has to... directly suckle from another woman's breast?\nWhat is this? Why does my chest feel so tight?\n\"Are they looking for a volunteer—\"\n\"I’ll do it. Um.. but.. you know. I don't have any experience.\"\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/2404037774)",
